🧠 OOP Concept

Encapsulation Rules & Friend Access

      Global Function show()
                 │
  (Allowed via friend keyword)
                 ↓
      Test Class [ private: value ]
                 ↑
   (Allowed via inline getter)
                 │
      obj.getValue() Execution

